# PSR-8c0 — Governance templates (not root)

## Intent

Prepare **draft templates** for LICENSE choice memo, SECURITY.md, and
CONTRIBUTING.md under `docs/audits/snapshots/2026-07-31/governance-templates/`
so Architect + counsel can land root files in `PSR-8c1` without inventing text
from scratch.

**Non-goals:** no root `LICENSE` / `SECURITY.md` / `CONTRIBUTING.md`; no license
SPDX selection; no claim L-GOV closed.

## Templates

| File | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `LICENSE.CHOICE.md` | Decision memo (OSS vs open-core vs source-available) |
| `SECURITY.md.template` | Vulnerability disclosure skeleton |
| `CONTRIBUTING.md.template` | Contribution / DCO skeleton |

## Smoke

```bash
node scripts/ops/psr-8c0-governance-templates-smoke.mjs
```

## Next

Architect + counsel → `PSR-8c1-governance-files-land` (copy to repo root).
Or YES packs / `PSR-7d1` accept.
